<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Highest/Lowest Australian P-E Ratios- Sept 12.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Highest/Lowest Australian P-E Ratios- Sept 12.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Highest and lowest price earnings ratios for Australian companies included in the 320-company All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on September 11. P/E based on rolling 12 months earnings.</p>
<p>Highest 10</p>
<p>Rank Name		    P/E	 Close</p>
<p>1  Portman Min	     277.78    1.75</p>
<p>2  Union Gold Mine	 214.29    1.50</p>
<p>3  Mayne Nickless	  191.18    8.45</p>
